{"4791750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mic Simulator", "steam_appid": 4791750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5068210], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4791750/extras/12c8a263a0655e195fc53ddf8e135d6e.avif?t=1786459176\" width=1178 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wondered how it is to be <strong>fatty</strong> and <i>smoky</i>? <br><br><strong><i>Mic Simulator</i></strong> puts you in the &quot;shoes&quot; of a Romanian mic, right on the grill. What's there to do? You're a mic, so fortunately, nothing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4791750/extras/6add824d609bfb20c54a77afeebca326.poster.avif?t=1786459176\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4791750/extras/6add824d609bfb20c54a77afeebca326.webm?t=1786459176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4791750/extras/6add824d609bfb20c54a77afeebca326.mp4?t=1786459176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some it's dream to know what if feels to be a mic, for you it's now a reality with Mic Simulator, where you simulate being a mic! A Romanian grilled membrane-less sausage food item! You're a mic! A little mic! Actually &quot;mic&quot; in Romanian translates to &quot;little&quot; so it's a &quot;little simulator&quot;. And the mic is small. Littles. Smalls. Simulator.<br><br>Anyway, it's an object simulator, and the object is a mic. You can stay in the perpetually sunny backyard and get smoked while you listen to the radio. And maybe try to get some achievements. But mostly you will be just standing on the grill, soaking in the sun.<br><br>Enjoy being a mic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now in Early Access!</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4791750/extras/12c8a263a0655e195fc53ddf8e135d6e.avif?t=1786459176\" width=1178 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wondered how it is to be <strong>fatty</strong> and <i>smoky</i>? <br><br><strong><i>Mic Simulator</i></strong> puts you in the &quot;shoes&quot; of a Romanian mic, right on the grill. What's there to do? You're a mic, so fortunately, nothing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4791750/extras/6add824d609bfb20c54a77afeebca326.poster.avif?t=1786459176\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4791750/extras/6add824d609bfb20c54a77afeebca326.webm?t=1786459176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4791750/extras/6add824d609bfb20c54a77afeebca326.mp4?t=1786459176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some it's dream to know what if feels to be a mic, for you it's now a reality with Mic Simulator, where you simulate being a mic! A Romanian grilled membrane-less sausage food item! You're a mic! A little mic! Actually &quot;mic&quot; in Romanian translates to &quot;little&quot; so it's a &quot;little simulator&quot;. And the mic is small. Littles. Smalls. Simulator.<br><br>Anyway, it's an object simulator, and the object is a mic. You can stay in the perpetually sunny backyard and get smoked while you listen to the radio. And maybe try to get some achievements. But mostly you will be just standing on the grill, soaking in the sun.<br><br>Enjoy being a mic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now in Early Access!</h2>", "short_description": "You are a mic! a Romanian skinless grilled sausage! on the grill! A third-person comedy sim about doing absolutely nothing while you're slowly getting smoked. Maybe you can listen to the radio? It's a nice day outside.", "supported_languages": "English, Romanian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4791750/c640e71e3d1302c778137d5243465e5432d9929a/header.jpg?t=1786459176", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4791750/426c2a6599d4e6b79444e35defaefb7f1d713002/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786459176", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4791750/426c2a6599d4e6b79444e35defaefb7f1d713002/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786459176", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX12/SM6, 4 GB VRAM: NVIDIA GTX 1060 / GTX 1650 / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional